      "widgets_values": [
        "先在 workflow_reference.json 编码并保存参考音色，刷新后选择含 references 的会话。第 1 个输出 References 接 Scene，按转写 speaker 标签复用；name 不参与绑定。\nSave references with workflow_reference.json, refresh, then select that voice-library session. Output 1 (References) feeds Scene; transcript speaker tags bind voices, not names.\n输出 0 仍是完整 Session，可接旧 Generate / Decode / Editor 连线。纯音色会话没有 take，不应直接接 Decode。\nOutput 0 remains Session for existing Generate/Decode/Editor links. Reference-only archives have no take to decode.\n本画布不附带私人音频或会话。\nNo private audio or sessions are distributed."
